--- !u!114 &114397708133318229
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1096037282869314}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: cbdfddbb1a7e9dedeeccda6985376314, type: 3}
  m_Name:
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  itemId: 440
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: 按照这个思路，你讲完传说后，便又开始讲一些关于化神强者的传闻，或是一些捕风捉影的故事。吞云大圣同样听的津津有味。
